<%- include('partials/head') %>
<%- include('partials/header') %>

<section class="hero hero-home">
  <div class="hero-media">
    <img src="<%= img('totally-mobile-hero-home-01-1920w.jpeg') %>" alt="Totally Mobile mobility equipment on Cape Cod" fetchpriority="high" width="1920" height="1080">
  </div>
  <div class="wrap hero-grid">
    <div class="hero-copy reveal">
      <p class="eyebrow">East Sandwich · Cape Cod &amp; the Islands · Since 1998</p>
      <h1>Wheelchairs, Stair Lifts &amp; Mobility Products in East Sandwich, MA</h1>
      <p class="hero-lede">Stairlifts, scooters, lift chairs &amp; beach wheelchairs — sales, rentals &amp; service on Cape Cod &amp; the Islands, from a locally and woman-owned team that comes to you.</p>
      <ul class="hero-points">
        <li>Variety Of Mobility Solutions</li>
        <li>1-Year Labor Warranty</li>
        <li>Free Personalized Consultation</li>
      </ul>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a class="btn btn-coral btn-lg" href="<%= site.phoneHref %>">Call <%= site.phone %></a>
        <a class="btn btn-ghost-light" href="#services">Browse products</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <aside class="hero-form reveal d2" aria-labelledby="hero-form-title">
      <h2 id="hero-form-title">Request a Call Back</h2>
      <p class="form-intro">Tell us what you need — we'll call you back with a free personalized consultation.</p>
      <%- include('partials/lead-form', { fid: 'hero', fname: 'Hero Request Form' }) %>
    </aside>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section intro">
  <div class="wrap split">
    <div class="split-copy">
      <p class="eyebrow">Your one-stop mobility shop</p>
      <h2>Rolling Along with You: Totally Mobile LLC Keeps You Moving!</h2>
      <p>Here at Totally Mobile LLC, we're all about keeping you mobile, moving, and grooving, especially when the beach calls your name. With our <a href="/beach-wheelchairs">beach wheelchairs</a>, you can enjoy the sand and sea without a second thought. Think of us as your one-stop mobility shop, where the fun doesn't stop just because you need a little extra help getting around.</p>
      <p>Since 1998, our locally and woman-owned business has been at the forefront of mobility solutions. With over 20 years under our belt, we've seen it all and fixed it all—from <a href="/scooters">scooters</a> to <a href="/manual-and-powered-wheelchairs">wheelchairs</a>, if we sell it, we repair it. And we're not just talking about minor tweaks here and there. We're here to assist with all <a href="/scooter-and-power-wheelchair-repair">repairs</a>, big or small.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="split-media">
      <img src="<%= img('totally-mobile-video-01-1920w.jpg') %>" alt="Learn more about Totally Mobile LLC" loading="lazy" width="900" height="600">
      <a class="video-chip" href="/hibu-video-splash"><span class="play" aria-hidden="true">▶</span> Watch our video</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section services" id="services">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head">
      <p class="eyebrow">Products &amp; services</p>
      <h2>Stair Lifts, Scooters, Wheelchairs, Ramps &amp; Rentals</h2>
      <p>Everything you need to stay independent at home and get out on the Cape — sold, installed, rented and repaired by one local team.</p>
    </div>
    <ul class="service-grid">
      <% servicePages.forEach(function(p, i){ %>
      <li class="service-card reveal">
        <a href="<%= p.path %>">
          <div class="service-img"><img src="<%= p.cardImg %>" alt="<%= p.nav %> from Totally Mobile" loading="lazy" width="600" height="420"></div>
          <div class="service-body">
            <h3><%= p.nav %></h3>
            <p><%= p.short %></p>
            <span class="more">Learn More <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></span>
          </div>
        </a>
      </li>
      <% }) %>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section why tide">
  <div class="wrap split split-rev">
    <div class="split-copy">
      <p class="eyebrow">The Totally Mobile difference</p>
      <h2>Why Choose Totally Mobile LLC?</h2>
      <p>Our commitment to you doesn't end with a sale. We offer a 1-year warranty on our labor, plus manufacturer warranties to ensure your mobility solutions are always in top-notch condition. But what really sets us apart is our personal touch. That's right, we come to you! No need to worry about how you'll get your powered wheelchair or scooter to us for repairs; we bring our expertise directly to your doorstep. We understand the importance of trust and ease, which is why our service is designed to ease your mind. We offer free personalized consultations to ensure you get exactly what you need.</p>
      <p>At Totally Mobile LLC, we're more than just a business; we're your partner in mobility and freedom. Let us keep you rolling along, whether it's a day at the beach or just another beautiful day in the neighborhood. Come join our family and see why we've been the go-to for mobility solutions since the '90s. Let's keep moving forward together!</p>
      <a class="btn btn-navy" href="/request-call-back">Request Call Back</a>
    </div>
    <ul class="why-grid">
      <li><strong>Variety</strong><span>Mobility Solutions to Choose From</span></li>
      <li><strong>Manufacturer</strong><span>Warranties Available</span></li>
      <li><strong>1-Year</strong><span>Labor Warranty</span></li>
      <li><strong>We Repair</strong><span>All Scooters and Wheelchairs</span></li>
      <li><strong>Free</strong><span>Personalized Consultation</span></li>
      <li><strong>Since 1998</strong><span>Locally &amp; Woman-Owned</span></li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section reviews-home">
  <div class="wrap split">
    <div class="split-copy">
      <p class="eyebrow">Reviews</p>
      <h2>Here's What Our Satisfied Patients Are Saying…</h2>
      <p>At Totally Mobile LLC, we take pride in providing exceptional wheelchairs and mobility products to our patients. We would be grateful if you could share your thoughts about our mobility equipment services with others. Your feedback helps us improve, and helps others make informed decisions. Please take a moment to leave a review of Totally Mobile LLC and let others know what you think.</p>
      <a class="btn btn-navy" href="/reviews">Read all reviews</a>
    </div>
    <div class="review-stack">
      <%- include('partials/review', { review: reviews.virginia }) %>
      <%- include('partials/review', { review: reviews.debby }) %>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section areas-home">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head">
      <p class="eyebrow">Where we work</p>
      <h2>Serving Cape Cod, Martha's Vineyard, Nantucket &amp; the South Shore</h2>
      <p>From our shop on Route 6A in East Sandwich we deliver, install and repair across every Cape town and beyond the bridges.</p>
    </div>
    <ul class="town-chips town-chips-lg">
      <% towns.forEach(function(t){ %><li><a href="/service-areas/<%= t.slug %>"><%= t.name %></a></li><% }) %>
    </ul>
    <p class="center"><a class="text-link" href="/service-areas">See all service areas →</a></p>
  </div>
</section>

<%- include('partials/cta-band') %>
<%- include('partials/footer') %>
